OL,3,GNEWSACommittee sets out priorities in
OL,4,Anew work plan
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe future of primary education, an
OL,7,Faudit of cultural provisions and a
OL,8,Flong-term location for Guernsey's new
OL,9,Fsixth form centre are among the
OL,10,Fgovernment's priorities for the next
OL,11,Fthree years, a new work plan has
OL,12,Frevealed.
OL,14,FGuernsey's Committee for Education,
OL,15,FSport and Culture has released its work
OL,16,Fplan for 2026-2029, setting out the
OL,17,Fareas it aims to focus on during the
OL,18,Frest of its tenure.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
