OL,3,GNEWSACommittee sets out priorities in
OL,4,Anew work plan
OL,5,
OL,6,FCommitments include a review into
OL,7,Fprimary education starting in 2027,
OL,8,Falong with a decision on the long term
OL,9,Ffuture of the sixth form site by the
OL,10,Fend of the year.
OL,12,FA review of the island's early years
OL,13,Ffunding and further education funding
OL,14,Fare also on the agenda.
